          "heading": "Jake White reported as leading candidate for Fiji head coach job",
          "body": "The Fiji head coach search has a leading name. Jake White, the former Springboks coach, was reported last week as the frontrunner for the job. A fresh search also turned up a report describing a World Cup-winning coach as the favourite for the post ahead of the 2027 World Cup. The search began when Fiji Rugby and Mick Byrne parted ways by mutual agreement in April, 18 months before the tournament."
