          "heading": "England's Tom Curry out of Sale side with illness before Harlequins clash",
          "body": "Tom Curry has withdrawn from Sale Sharks' side with illness, forcing director of rugby Alex Sanderson into a reshuffle for Sale's round three PREM clash with Harlequins. The England back-rower was due to start on the openside against the bottom-ranked Londoners. Christ Tshiunza now comes into the back row, while Sam Dugdale is promoted onto the bench."
