          "kicker": "Next up",
          "heading": "France's next Nations Championship Test is Fiji in Round four",
          "body": "France's next Test is against Fiji in Round four of the Nations Championship. The fixture follows a 42-15 win over Japan in Round three, which took France to two wins from three matches, with their only defeat coming in that run. Across those three games they have scored 116 points and conceded 75, a points difference of +41."
