          "kicker": "Munster governance",
          "heading": "Munster name Avan Lee interim chief executive as Ian Flanagan steps down",
          "body": "Munster have appointed New Zealander Avan Lee as interim chief executive, with Ian Flanagan stepping down after months of heavy criticism over governance. Lee is a former Hurricanes chief, described in coverage as an experienced Super Rugby franchise boss. The moves were reported earlier this month, and the interim appointment leaves the permanent chief executive role unfilled."
