          "heading": "Italy's 34-19 win over Chile is their biggest win in last 11",
          "body": "Across their last 11 games, Italy have scored 190 points and conceded 318, which works out at averages of 17.3 scored and 28.9 conceded a game. Their biggest win in that window was a 34-19 home victory over Chile in November 2025, an International Friendlies fixture. Gonzalo Quesada's side face the reigning world champions, South Africa, in round four of the Nations Championship."
