          "heading": "Darcy Graham ruled out of Scotland's autumn Tests with ruptured bicep",
          "body": "Darcy Graham is out of Scotland's autumn Tests with a ruptured bicep, according to reports on 25 September that ruled the winger out of the November window. A search headline since then describes him as out for the rest of the year, but today's search found no newer update on his recovery or any return date. Scotland's next fixture is against New Zealand, and Graham's absence is an autumn injury blow the squad must plan around."
