          "heading": "Tom Rogers wins man of the match at 15 in Ospreys win",
          "body": "Tom Rogers was named man of the match as Ospreys beat Dragons at Rodney Parade, taking over the 15 jersey after starting on the wing. Ospreys head coach Mark Jones said: \"I really loved the way he beat the first man almost every time to get us on the front foot.\" Rogers scored a Wales hat-trick against New Zealand in November 2025, and Steve Tandy has plenty to ponder before naming his Nations Championship squad."
