          "heading": "Two men jailed for murder of former Argentina rugby player Aramburú",
          "body": "Weeks ago, two men were given lengthy jail terms for the murder of Aramburú, a former Argentina rugby player. It is far from the pitch, but it concerns one of the Pumas' own. On the field, Argentina's next opponent is Ireland in the Nations Championship, and Los Pumas come in having lost 24-31 to England in Round 3 after one win from three."
