      "edition": "Monday 12 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Bledisloe response",
          "heading": "Les Kiss vows Wallabies will return fire in Sydney Bledisloe rematch",
          "body": "Les Kiss has already turned to next Saturday's Bledisloe Cup rematch at Accor Stadium in Sydney, insisting the Wallabies will go back to work and return fire after the 50-19 loss at Eden Park. It was the first defeat of Kiss's tenure, ending a five-match unbeaten run, and he said the review would focus on how to get Australia's strengths into the game while nullifying New Zealand's. New Zealand have now retained the Bledisloe Cup for a 23rd successive year."
        },
        {
